usage: tetriz-connectors simulator [flags]

Serve the vendor simulator, which needs no credentials and checks none. TETRIZ_SIMULATOR_DSN names its Postgres database.

Flags:
  -addr string
    	listen address; the simulator is unauthenticated, so bind it to all interfaces (":8080") only on a private network (default "127.0.0.1:8080")
  -seed
    	seed the demo catalog before serving
